1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
To win a battle at sea,

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:03,660
he pulled seventy warships out of the

3
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:03,860
sea.

4
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,440
You see, the city's harbor is locked

5
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:07,200
by a giant iron chain.

6
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:08,600
His fleet rams it,

7
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:09,740
and bounces right off.

8
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,560
The defenders laugh from the walls:

9
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:13,020
"Ships can't climb hills."

10
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:14,080
Weeks pass.

11
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:15,260
The walls hold.

12
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:17,180
Supply ships slip into the harbor.

13
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:19,260
And his own generals whisper that it's

14
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:19,960
time to go home.

15
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:21,700
So he orders his men to cut

16
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:22,880
a forest into logs,

17
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,380
lay them over the hill behind the

18
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:26,300
harbor, and cover them in grease.

19
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:28,640
His officers whisper, "Does he think ships

20
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:29,220
can walk?"

21
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:31,640
In one night, thousands of men drag

22
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:32,740
the ships out of the water,

23
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:34,160
onto the greasy logs,

24
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:35,160
and up the hill.

25
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:37,000
And the sailors sit at their oars,

26
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:39,160
raise the sails, and row through the

27
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:40,400
air, while the drums beat.

28
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:42,240
You see, the chain guards the water.

29
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:43,740
Nobody guards the hill.

30
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:44,960
And on greased logs,

31
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:46,920
a ship slides almost as easily as

32
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:47,260
it floats.

33
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:49,280
At dawn, the defenders look down at

34
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:50,720
their safe harbor and freeze.

35
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,200
Seventy enemy ships are floating inside it.

36
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:53,900
And the chain?

37
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:54,600
Still locked.

